      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "title": "Start here",
      "widgets_values": [
        "# scail2 int8 masks\n\nUpload source and reference. Keep one continuous shot. Start at 480 x 832, 16 fps, 81 frames. Use the same dimensions and seed when comparing adapters.\n\nThe reference should clearly show the face, hair and clothing. Describe those in the positive prompt. Track a specific person by their clothing if several people appear. object_indices=0 selects the first tracked person after sorting.\n\nThe fast preset couples 6 steps, CFG 1 and the speed adapter. Undistilled uses 40 steps, CFG 5 and speed strength 0. Neither preset guarantees a better result on every shot.\n\nFor a new shot leave context_path empty and skip_frames=0. For continuation, paste the saved relative context path and set skip_frames to source_end_frame minus 5. The next pass drops the five overlapping frames and keeps the matching audio.\n\nLoRA slots A/B accept None. Use adapters made for this model; arbitrary Wan 2.2 adapters are not interchangeable.\n\nNo added content filters or hosted generation APIs. Recorded RTX 3090 demo results and remaining quality limits are in validation/gpu-report.json. Longer GPU continuation and 20-step 704p settings remain unbenchmarked."
      ]
    }
